+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2FTMXD2QGV91CGDAFY0YQ0S","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T11:10:51Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["dpdp-rules-2025:8(3)","dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(a)","sebi-cscrf-2024:ID.AM.S5"],"title":"evidence-request: 3 in onfinance-db-model-master","description":"Three evidence-request gaps in db-models-mongodb.default: (1) collection 'user' holds personal data (user_email, user_phone_number, user_full_name, user_fcm_id), SPDI (user_password, user_binance_auth_creds, user_debank_url) and client financial data (user_portfolio_holdings with purchase_price/purchase_qty, user_equity_portfolio_value, user_crypto_portfolio_value) with no retention setting, TTL index or expiry field in code; requested the company's record-retention schedule against dpdp-rules-2025 8(3) (keep personal data and processing logs at least 365 days then erase) and Act-8(7) erasure, plus the record-keeping basis for the holdings/portfolio data. (2) collection 'secrets' stores broker trading-account credentials as plain StringField (zerodha_username, zerodha_password, zerodha_2fa, apiSecrets, accessToken, accountName) with no hashing, field-level encryption or TTL, the same pattern as user.user_binance_auth_creds; requested evidence of encryption at rest or field-level encryption for these SPDI fields under dpdp-rules-2025 6(1)(a), access control on the collection, and a retention/erasure schedule. (3) several other collections carry personal-data identifiers with no retention in code: new_discussions (author_id, author_name, author_profile_pic, sub_comments author fields), entity.social_discussions (scraped social-media author identifiers), entity.stock_tips.expert_name, communities.community_admin_name, feedback.feedback_uid, reward.winning_user; requested the retention/erasure schedule against dpdp-rules-2025 8(3) and whether the company relies on the DPDP publicly-available-data exemption for the scraped data. No in-scope requirement gives a fixed retention period for client holdings or portfolio data, so no retention-below-regulatory gap is raised for that; these remain requests for evidence, not confirmed gaps.","methods":["refresh-metastore"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T11:10:49Z","result":"inconclusive","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:387"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:406"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:352"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:8"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:11"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:12"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:397"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:84"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:33"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:29"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:483"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master/onfinance_db_model_master/models.py:487"}],"provenance":{"harness":"claude-code","generatedAt":"2026-09-14T11:10:49Z","sessionId":"cb91f6b0-eba